WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.974 --> 00:00:03.824
- So I took that
Pottermore quiz yesterday.

00:00:03.947 --> 00:00:05.601
I got sorted in to Slytherin.

00:00:05.734 --> 00:00:06.908
- What's wrong with Slytherin?

00:00:06.908 --> 00:00:08.393
- [Voiceover] People assume being sorted

00:00:08.393 --> 00:00:10.656
in to Slytherin is a bad thing.

00:00:11.416 --> 00:00:13.292
- You know, "there's not a single

00:00:13.292 --> 00:00:16.169
witch or wizard who went bad
that wasn't in Slytherin."

00:00:16.169 --> 00:00:18.668
- A, that's not true,
and B, I'm a Slytherin.

00:00:18.668 --> 00:00:19.353
- Really?

00:00:19.353 --> 00:00:20.896
- [Voiceover] They consider them selfish,

00:00:20.896 --> 00:00:22.765
power hungry, and evil.

00:00:22.765 --> 00:00:23.672
- But you're not evil.

00:00:23.672 --> 00:00:24.891
- Exactly, I'm not.

00:00:24.891 --> 00:00:26.888
- [Voiceover] In truth, there's
a lot more to Slytherins

00:00:26.888 --> 00:00:29.504
than just being one of the bad guys.

00:00:34.352 --> 00:00:37.091
Slytherins are often perceived
as being power hungry.

00:00:37.091 --> 00:00:39.112
- Yeah I'm gonna be out
of the office next week

00:00:39.112 --> 00:00:42.177
for a little vacation,
but if someone could

00:00:42.177 --> 00:00:43.808
take over in the meantime?

00:00:43.985 --> 00:00:45.133
- [Voiceover] And though it's true

00:00:45.133 --> 00:00:46.554
they like to be in control,

00:00:46.554 --> 00:00:47.377
- I'll do it.

00:00:47.377 --> 00:00:49.769
- [Voiceover] It's not always
for reasons you'd expect.

00:00:49.769 --> 00:00:51.321
- Alright, now that I'm in charge,

00:00:51.321 --> 00:00:52.893
everyone can bring
their dog to the office.

00:00:54.633 --> 00:00:56.515
- [Voiceover] It's true Slytherins can get

00:00:56.515 --> 00:00:58.228
a little competitive sometimes,

00:00:59.278 --> 00:01:01.129
okay very competitive.

00:01:05.094 --> 00:01:06.557
And yes, they're not exactly the

00:01:06.557 --> 00:01:08.669
easiest people to make friends with.

00:01:08.669 --> 00:01:10.737
- Hi, I'm Chantelle, I'm new here.

00:01:10.737 --> 00:01:12.257
- Cool, welcome.

00:01:12.257 --> 00:01:15.039
- [Voiceover] That doesn't
mean they're horrible people.

00:01:15.329 --> 00:01:19.083
They just prefer to have a
small group of tightly knit

00:01:19.083 --> 00:01:22.618
friends compared to a large
group of mediocre ones.

00:01:22.618 --> 00:01:24.575
- And then I said, "witch please!."

00:01:24.575 --> 00:01:26.361
(laughter)

00:01:26.361 --> 00:01:28.161
Yes, yes!

00:01:28.161 --> 00:01:29.438
- [Voiceover] And if anyone messes

00:01:29.438 --> 00:01:31.216
with part of their inner circle...

00:01:31.216 --> 00:01:33.294
- Hey, what's up, you're Ravenclaw right?

00:01:33.294 --> 00:01:35.278
- [Voiceover] ...that
person better watch out.

00:01:36.928 --> 00:01:39.934
If a Slytherin is ever
looking particularly evil,

00:01:39.934 --> 00:01:42.383
it's usually for a good reason.

00:01:42.383 --> 00:01:43.731
- So I'm sure you're all curious

00:01:43.731 --> 00:01:45.426
who the Employee of the Month is?

00:01:45.426 --> 00:01:49.066
Zayn was again our top
performer in terms of numbers,

00:01:49.386 --> 00:01:50.657
but we're actually gonna give it

00:01:50.657 --> 00:01:53.124
to Kenny for his moral fiber.

00:01:54.210 --> 00:01:55.498
- [Voiceover] Really though, Dumbledore's

00:01:55.498 --> 00:01:57.025
a (bleeped) asshat.

00:01:57.739 --> 00:01:59.991
If you've been sorted in to Slytherin,

00:01:59.991 --> 00:02:02.041
don't let that get you down.

00:02:02.371 --> 00:02:04.838
Remember, it could always be worse.

00:02:05.076 --> 00:02:06.986
You could have been a Hufflepuff.

00:02:07.258 --> 00:02:09.726
- I found some cookies
if anyone wants, ahhh!

00:02:11.140 --> 00:02:13.058
I got surprised by your teeth.

